Spec: SpecDD Documentation Provider

Platform: IntelliJ Platform / Kotlin

Purpose:
  Connect SpecDD section documentation to IntelliJ hover documentation.

Owns:
  ./SpecDDDocumentationProvider.kt

Can modify:
  ./SpecDDDocumentationProvider.kt

Can read:
  ./SpecDDSectionDocumentation.kt
  /src/main/kotlin/ai/specdd/idea/parser/*
  /src/main/kotlin/ai/specdd/idea/SpecDDFileType.kt
  /src/test/kotlin/ai/specdd/idea/documentation/SpecDDDocumentationProviderBehaviorSpec.kt

Must:
  Implement IntelliJ `DocumentationProvider`.
  Use `getCustomDocumentationElement` to resolve documentation at the editor hover offset.
  Resolve documentation only for SpecDD files.
  Classify the target line with `SpecDDLineClassifier`.
  Return a documentation element only when the target offset is inside a known section label range.
  Generate documentation from the resolved documentation element.
  Return no documentation for non-SpecDD files and non-section-label offsets.

Must not:
  Define section documentation text directly.
  Report validation diagnostics.
  Define syntax highlighting behavior.
